// nettest: MOVED UP from just above server/sv_bots.qc.  QC forward-declares FUNCTIONS but not ARRAYS, so anything that touches nav_* storage directly must compile after this file.  sv_navnodes.qc itself calls only builtins (cvar, dprint, find, remove, sprintf, tracebox, traceline, vlen) and its own functions, so it can sit this early with no forward references of its own.
server/sv_navnodes.qc
// AI substrate: constants + fields only, no code.  Must precede every other AI
// file AND server/sv_monsters.qc, which reaches the AI layer through
// forward-declared FUNCTIONS only -- QC forward-declares functions but not
// arrays, so AI arrays stay owned by the files below this line.
